<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Davox Corp raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Davox Corp raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Albany said it raised Davox Corp to buy from neutral and set a 12-month price target of $43 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- In a report, analyst Herbert Tinger cited his expectation that revenues should continue to grow at 30 percent or more and gross margin will continue to trend slightly upward, and Davox's steady building of backlog, among other factors.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Tuesday at 34-3/4.</p>
</text>
